WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:03.620
Well, Madoka said that she'd be...

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:07.700
...spending New Year's with her family, in America.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.460
A...America?!

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:12.140
Now, you are my slave!

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.900
Master, command me as you will.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.460
She's really hypnotized!

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:23.160
K... Kasuga!

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.920
Yu... Yuusaku! Er...
K... Kasuga!

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:50.160
On usual, precious nights,
I'd be riding by your side...

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:56.230
...as you take me in your car for a ride.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:01.040
I hung up the phone,
when you called to cancel the date...

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:08.140
...I tried to pretend that there wasn't a scent of lie.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:14.050
The color of my manicure, as it dries...

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:19.420
...only serves to glamorize this night...

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.020
A-ha-ha...

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.930
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.930
Got to be more straightforward to say it...

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:30.600
...but uncertainty whispers into my ear...

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.070
'Cause I love you...

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.840
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:37.810
each time I act, the truth leaves further...

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:43.110
...and further from my face. You've broken my heart.

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:43.950
A-HA-HA

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:46.820
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.790
Got to be able to cry...

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:54.520
...but my pride keeps revising my dialogue...

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:55.960
'Cause I love you...

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:58.900
The Actress in the Mirror...

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:01.830
There's no turning back now that I've realized...

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:08.790
...the seriousness of the crime. You've broken my heart.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:25.680
Hypnotizing Madoka!
Kyosuke's Risky New Year's.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:07.390
I woke up to the sound of my stomach growling.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:11.360
The fact that I didn't have
my First Dream of the New Year...

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.730
...made me feel like I'd
missed out on something big.

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:43.120
Happy New Year, Darling.

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:45.700
A...Ayukawa...

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.890
How about some Ozouni? Or...
"Ozouni:" A traditional New Year's soup.

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:50.980
"Ozouni:" A traditional New Year's soup.

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:51.070
"Otoso:" New Year's Medicine-in-Sake.

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:54.040
...some Otoso, perhaps?
"Otoso:" New Year's Medicine-in-Sake.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.970
Please tell me how I may serve you, Master.

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:09.640
T... This must be a dream...

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:17.560
It's got to be a dream!

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.870
Yup... 'Twas a dream...

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:40.780
Hey Kyosuke, when are you getting up?!
Are you ready to go yet?!

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:54.270
Still, talk about a wild dream!

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:55.530
Could it be a Foreboding Dream?!

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:55.790
Hey!
Could it be a Foreboding Dream?!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:05:00.270
Now you've entered the hypnotically susceptible state of "Deep Sleep!"

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:04.010
And now, you are a dog!

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:10.810
Yeah, I did it! Paw please!

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:14.540
Run around me three times!

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:21.210
Sit!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.190
No, no! That's not sitting!

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.620
Kurumi, that's enough.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:29.690
Okay, that's it.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:38.970
Yeah! I'm gonna show Grandpa my hypnotic skills!

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:43.630
Oh, no! He might still be hypnotized!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:46.270
What the...? What did you do?!
Why you, hold it!

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:48.840
Kyosuke... We'll leave without you, if you don't get ready right now!

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:51.670
Oh! Huh?

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:53.900
Leave... Like, where to? I forgot.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:57.810
Gosh... We're spending New Year's
at Grandpa's! Don't you remember?!

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:59.670
Oh, that's right...

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:03.190
But, now wait a sec...
The dream I just had...

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:11.790
If that was a Foreboding Dream...

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:14.930
Say... Oniichan, what's wrong?

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:17.210
I wonder if he's been
hypnotized all his life...?

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:20.650
Clearly, the Otoshidama is tempting...
"Otoshidama:" New Year's money given to children.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:20.740
"Otoshidama:" New Year's money given to children.

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:25.190
...but then, Ayukawa in a bunny costume
is not to be missed...!

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.980
Now, you are asleep!

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.460
He's hopeless.

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:42.630
Let's just go, Papa. If we have to wait for Oniichan, we'll miss New Year's!

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:51.040
You mean, Darling,
she made you sleep all this time?

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.370
Yeah.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:57.440
"Hypnosis" sounds so...
laid back for New Year's Eve, eh, Kasuga?

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:00.690
Gee, get off my case, Master.

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:03.470
By the way, where's Ayukawa?

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:06.150
Well, Madoka said that she'd be heading off to America today.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.950
She should be getting ready right now.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.550
A...America?!

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:13.070
Spending time with her parents. She said she had no choice.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.450
"Wouldn't you want to spend the New Year's holiday...

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.390
"...with the special someone
who means the most to you?"

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:20.440
"Wouldn't we all?"

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:31.010
Spending New Year's in America... I'm so envious!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.360
Yeah.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.740
Still...

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:44.980
...even if it's only a few days...

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:48.000
...the fact that I won't be able
to see Ayukawa...

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.550
Ayukawa!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.900
Ow...

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:01.730
Ayukawa! What happened?!

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:03.750
Ayukawa!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.600
Kasuga...

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:11.320
I'm fine... I got a little dizzy...

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:13.290
Ayukawa!

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:27.830
Let's see...

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:50.140
If I... If I wake her up now...

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:53.320
...she'll go off to America.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:57.160
If that happens...

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.290
Hello?

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:13.320
Oh. Hikaru...?

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:19.620
I had no idea you'd be
so considerate, Kasuga.

00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:21.760
A...Ayukawa!

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:23.840
Oh... Er... Well...

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:26.730
I thought that you'd need to warm up a little, so...

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.630
If you'd like to, the water should be perfect by now.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:35.100
You're under arrest for
"Trespassing on Private Property!"

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:44.750
Gosh!

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:55.220
She decided not to go?!

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:59.110
Yet another one of Madoka's whims, perhaps?

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:04.050
Well then, I'm gonna bear down and finish up my work here, Master!

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:04.300
Indeedy!

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.530
Uh-huh...
Indeedy!

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:05.620
Indeedy!

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:10.280
Oh, it looks so good!
I'm such a sucker for Soba-noodles!

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:12.310
If I may!

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:17.230
Say, Ayukawa... are you really all right now?

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.460
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:22.630
I got a little dizzy back there, that's all.

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:26.730
Well, I heard that you were
leaving for America all of a sudden so...

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:28.760
Oh yeah... America...

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:34.030
Don't... you need to go?

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:38.910
Is it better if I do?

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.970
N...No...

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:47.630
This must be... my first time...

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:48.510
Huh?

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:49.600
To be like this...
Huh?

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:49.690
Huh?

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:49.780
"Toshikoshi:" served on New Year's Eve to wish longevity, good health.

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:53.840
To enjoy Toshikoshi Soba-noodles together with someone.

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:53.930
"Toshikoshi:" served on New Year's Eve to wish longevity, good health.

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:57.710
Lucky me. Thanks to Kurumi's hypnosis, I'm having great Soba!

00:11:58.490 --> 00:11:59.760
"Hypnosis?!"

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:02.050
Yeah. And it's pretty potent too.
"Hypnosis?!"

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:02.140
"Hypnosis?!"

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:05.510
If I were to hypnotize you,
you'd end up obeying my every command!

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:07.950
Wow... Like, how?

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:11.470
Huh? Er... Well... like...

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:18.130
Like... Now, you are my slave!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.720
Just kidding!

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.800
So, when I do something like that... Huh...?

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:40.880
Master, command me as you will.

00:12:40.880 --> 00:12:42.640
What?!

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:45.390
Oh, gee! Stop kidding me, Ayukawa!

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.880
She's really hypnotized!

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:42.460
Umao! Wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:47.960
Ushiko! And, wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:51.150
Er... W...Well... But, er...

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:54.820
"Command me as you will?"
How am I supposed to answer that?!

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:57.190
I know! A...Ayukawa! Oops, I meant...

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.280
Madoka!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.040
Yes, sir.
Madoka!

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:00.900
Lemme see...

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.900
Tea! Please bring me some tea.

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:04.450
Er, I mean, go get it for me.

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:05.480
Yes, sir.
Er, I mean, go get it for me.

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:20.360
My... But, is it really okay for me to be doing this?

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:23.740
Here you go, sir.

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:26.040
Th...Thank you.
Here you go, sir.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:26.130
Here you go, sir.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:29.900
That dream was...
a Foreboding Dream after all!

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:34.630
She's under hypnosis. That means...

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:36.840
For instance...

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:39.120
Gotcha!

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:44.150
On top of that, I could do something like...

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:02.140
O...Ow!

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:06.530
Are you all right, Master?

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:08.580
Y...Yeah.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.000
I know!

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:16.980
Madoka, how about massaging my shoulders?

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:18.690
Yes, Master.

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:28.530
Oh, man... Okay,
now how about cleaning my ears?

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:37.220
Life is good!

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:42.430
Okay, now how about something like washing me in the bath, maybe?

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:44.490
Yes, sir.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:48.960
Just kidding! I was just kidding!

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:49.390
Sir?
Just kidding! I was just kidding!

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:51.430
Er... Never mind!
Sir?

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.770
No matter what the circumstances were,
I felt that...

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:58.420
...there was no way that we should be bathing together.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:03.020
Seeing her like this, Ayukawa seemed to me to be charming beyond words.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:05.140
Is there a problem, Master?

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:07.110
Oh... No!
Is there a problem, Master?

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:10.290
Say! Say, you, my New Year's Eve Girl!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:10.350
"Kanetsuki:" the ringing of large bells
at Buddhist shrines on New Year's Eve.

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:12.010
Wanna go do the Kanetsuki with me tonight?

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:12.350
"Kanetsuki:" the ringing of large bells
at Buddhist shrines on New Year's Eve.

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:14.470
And after the clang, let's cling!

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:17.680
Hey, girls!

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:21.090
Master, what is the matter?

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:23.250
Er, no... It's nothing!
Master, what is the matter?

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:28.500
Kasuga!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.460
Ayukawa!
Kasuga!

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.410
You guys! What do you think you're doing here?!

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:34.650
Oh, er... Well...

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:35.370
Hey, hey, my man! Lookin' good!

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:37.530
You're hot! Lookin' good, you two!

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:37.620
Hey, hey, my man! Lookin' good!

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:39.920
H... Hey! You kids!

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:41.110
Have a Happy New Year's!

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:42.940
Oh! H...Hey! Stop!
Have a Happy New Year's!

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:43.030
Have a Happy New Year's!

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.040
Hold it, you!

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:00.060
Hey! Hold it!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:04.630
I should've known...
that taking her out would be a big mistake!

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:12.830
Dammit! Where the hell did Kasuga go?!

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.310
Master...

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:21.350
L...Let's go home, Madoka.
Master...

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.040
Yes, sir.
L...Let's go home, Madoka.

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:31.120
Whoa! Oh, gee! Watch what you're doing!
Such a waste!

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.510
Get me another one, why don't you?!

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.300
K...Kasuga!

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:37.200
Y...Yuusaku!
K...Kasuga!

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:44.340
M...Madoka...

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.670
W...Well, I can explain...

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.840
Kasuga, how dare you...!
W...Well, I can explain...

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:51.180
You're dead meat!

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:51.940
Yikes!
You're dead meat!

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:52.050
You're dead meat!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:54.500
M...Madoka, you're not
completely innocent either.

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:55.880
This is so unfair to Hikaru...

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.040
Master?
This is so unfair to Hikaru...

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:57.130
This is so unfair to Hikaru...

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.650
I don't understand what
this person is talking about.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:09.820
Y...Yuusaku!

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:13.080
H...Hey! My coffee! Wait a second!

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:15.100
Hey!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.880
Shazam!

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:27.170
What do you think, Master?

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:29.270
Oh! Now that's something!

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:31.030
Why, I might even throw in
something extra...

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:34.140
...on top of your regular pay!

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:36.350
Lucky me!

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:40.970
Oh, thanks a lot.

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.740
Okay now! The shop's now closed for this year!

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:46.050
Guess we'll have a late snack and then...

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:49.260
New Year's Day Shrine-Visiting!
Darling's in for a surprise, I hope!

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:52.010
H...Hikaru...

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:03.120
Goddammit!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:05.090
Hey!
Goddammit!

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.520
What's his problem?!

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.530
The bath... It feels perfect now.

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:15.600
O... okay.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:19.100
O... O... It's okay!

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:23.490
I...I can get undressed myself.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:27.030
S...Still... I hope this isn't a sin.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.440
"I can... wash your back for you."

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:44.830
Yup, that's it!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:47.960
I can... wash your back for you.

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.480
Oh! Yes, please! Please do!

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:54.220
Then I shall go to my room and disrobe.

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:56.930
Huh? Y...You could do it right here...

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:01.140
Oh, never mind! Yes, you're right!
Do like you said.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:22.170
It's unforgivable!

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:26.060
Now he's done it to Madoka as well...
Kasuga Kyosuke...

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:28.920
I declare that... that you...

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:30.940
...can't be forgiven!

00:20:36.180 --> 00:20:38.530
Ayukawa!

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:40.670
Ayukawa, what's the problem?

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:47.010
I wonder if she's still a bit embarrassed, even when under hypnosis?!

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:13.370
H...Hikaru?!

00:21:14.220 --> 00:21:16.550
W...What brings her here this late at night?!

00:21:17.090 --> 00:21:19.740
"Madoka? Huh...?"

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:22.720
"Er... Er... Hikaru!"

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:26.280
"D...Darling... What are you doing here?!"

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:29.250
"No...I, er..."

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:33.490
"Don't tell me... Don't tell me that you and Madoka..."

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:36.640
"No! No!"

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:48.140
Dammit! There!

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.750
Yippee! Darling!

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:51.760
Huh?!
Yippee! Darling!

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:53.320
Here I am at last!
Huh?!

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:53.450
Here I am at last!

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:55.580
Hikaru, n...now...
Here I am at last!

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:55.670
Here I am at last!

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:57.690
Well? Shall we go out...

00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:00.560
to do our New Year's Shrine-Visiting?

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:06.030
What?!

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:08.160
Gosh, you didn't know?!
What?!

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:08.250
What?!

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:11.100
Madoka and I decided to do it
this afternoon over the phone.

00:22:11.870 --> 00:22:14.360
What?!

00:22:14.360 --> 00:22:18.210
Still, Madoka, why did you decide not to go to America?

00:22:18.710 --> 00:22:22.360
Huh? Er, well... I changed my mind, y'know...

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:24.290
Y...You mean...!

00:22:24.290 --> 00:22:26.290
Your pants... They're on backwards.
Y...You mean...!

00:22:26.290 --> 00:22:27.010
Huh?
Your pants... They're on backwards.

00:22:38.070 --> 00:22:40.260
H...Hold it, you! Ayukawa!

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:46.430
Hey! What's going on, you two?

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:49.860
Hold it!

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:55.170
It was all an... act put on by Ayukawa.

00:22:55.170 --> 00:22:57.000
Grrr!

00:22:57.000 --> 00:22:59.190
Indeed, Ayukawa...

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:01.460
...always being one step ahead...

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:03.140
...is an angel.

00:23:03.140 --> 00:23:04.620
Grrr! Huh?

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:08.300
Kasuga!

00:23:15.640 --> 00:23:18.470
You're dead!

00:23:18.840 --> 00:23:20.070
What the...?!

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:34.000
We wish you a Happy New Year!

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:35.560
Er... yes!

00:23:49.840 --> 00:23:58.350
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:23:58.350 --> 00:24:02.230
At a train station on a faraway day...

00:24:02.230 --> 00:24:13.940
...snowflakes dance on the platform,
and you came running, out of breath.

00:24:13.940 --> 00:24:19.710
The days we had to be apart made the memory of you...

00:24:19.710 --> 00:24:28.050
...a happy one, like seeing your photograph.

00:24:28.050 --> 00:24:35.590
"I just dance in the sweet memories" Each time we're hurt we learn...

00:24:35.590 --> 00:24:43.230
"I just dance in the sweet memories" ...what it takes to love someone.

00:24:43.230 --> 00:24:50.870
"I just dance in the sweet memories"
(He's my one and only; you never can tell)

00:24:50.870 --> 00:24:58.410
"I just dance in the sweet memories" (Sweet memories)

00:24:58.410 --> 00:25:04.430
"I just dance in the sweet memories"

00:25:06.910 --> 00:25:09.410
A Toho Preview

00:25:11.950 --> 00:25:14.300
Out of nowhere comes
the mysterious "Monster G."

00:25:14.300 --> 00:25:17.840
When missiles prove useless,
our only hope is those brave youths...

00:25:17.840 --> 00:25:19.000
The T.A.P. Guns!

00:25:19.000 --> 00:25:21.600
Who'll win this battle, on which
the future of civilization depends?

00:25:21.600 --> 00:25:25.240
And, will love vanish miserably in the heat of battle?

00:25:25.240 --> 00:25:27.580
Next time - the New Year's Special:

00:25:27.580 --> 00:25:31.000
"First Dream of the New Year!
Jingoro the Giant Monster Strikes Back!"
